---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE, EDUCATION, SKILL_CATEGORIES } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout title={`About — ${SITE.name}`} description="Engineering philosophy, background, education, and technical competencies of Bishweshwar Shome.">
  <div class="about-page">
    <div class="container">
      <!-- Header -->
      <header class="page-header">
        <span class="badge badge-cyan">BACKGROUND &amp; PHILOSOPHY</span>
        <h1 class="page-title">About Bishweshwar Shome</h1>
        <p class="page-lead">
          Senior Software Engineer based in Bengaluru, India. Builder of resilient distributed backends,
          high-throughput microservices, and AI-driven automation workflows.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="about-grid">
        <!-- Main Bio & Story -->
        <div class="about-main prose">
          <section>
            <h2>Engineering Philosophy</h2>
            <p>
              I approach software engineering from first principles: <strong>reliability</strong>, <strong>operational simplicity</strong>, and <strong>low-level mechanical sympathy</strong>. Whether tuning Linux socket buffers, designing atomic Redis Lua scripts to eliminate race conditions, or enforcing zero-allocation hot paths in Go, I believe scalable software begins with clear boundaries and respect for the underlying machine.
            </p>
            <p>
              Over 6+ years in software engineering, I have designed and maintained core systems across Cloud VPC networking overlays, scientific simulation engines, and AI testing pipelines. I take pride in removing friction for engineering teams — whether by shaving 56% off container footprints, accelerating service startup times by 50%, or architecting AI agents that eliminate merge request test regressions.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>The Journey</h2>
            <p>
              My academic foundations in Computer Science began at <strong>Visva-Bharati University</strong>, where I earned both my Bachelor's and Master's degrees in Computer Science. During my Master's studies, I concentrated on Quantum Computing, Distributed Systems, and Cryptography, culminating in research on Quantum Genetic Algorithms (QGA) for discrete optimization.
            </p>
            <p>
              Professionally, my journey spans:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <strong>F5 Networks (SDE III)</strong>: Pioneered LLM-powered test automation agents and MR diff coverage pipelines, increasing test coverage to 90%+ across multiple repositories, and delivered critical cross-repo validation features.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>IBM Cloud VPC Overlay</strong>: Engineered load balancer VPC routing, Virtual Private Endpoint (VPE) access, and high-concurrency Go networking microservices.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>HCL Technologies</strong>: Developed scalable REST APIs with Go and the Goa framework, gRPC inter-service communication, and Terraform infrastructure.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Prescience Insilico</strong>: Spearheaded performance optimizations for materials simulation and drug discovery software, slashing Docker image sizes and optimizing data connectors.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>Current Research &amp; Learning</h2>
            <p>
              Technology moves forward through deliberate experimentation. Currently, I am actively exploring:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Rust</strong>: Leveraging affine type systems and fearless concurrency for systems programming and WebAssembly.</li>
              <li><strong>Quantum Computing</strong>: Simulating quantum gate circuits, superposition probability mechanics, and quantum-inspired combinatorial optimization.</li>
              <li><strong>Autonomous AI Workflows</strong>: Designing context-aware code generation loops that integrate compiler feedback, static analysis, and AST diffs.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>Beyond the Terminal</h2>
            <p>
              When not reading RFCs, profiling goroutines, or writing Go code, you will find me:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>♟️ Playing <strong>Chess</strong> (tactics, positional play, and opening theory).</li>
              <li>🥾 <strong>Trekking &amp; Traveling</strong> across mountain trails and natural landscapes.</li>
              <li>📷 <strong>Photography</strong> capturing street and wilderness moments.</li>
              <li>✍️ <strong>Technical Writing</strong> publishing deep dives on Medium and Dev Genius.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>
        </div>

        <!-- Sidebar: Education & Skills -->
        <aside class="about-sidebar">
          <!-- Profile Snapshot Card -->
          <div class="card sidebar-card">
            <h3 class="sidebar-title">Profile Snapshot</h3>
            <div class="snapshot-list">
              <div class="snapshot-item">
                <span class="snapshot-label">Current Role:</span>
                <span class="snapshot-val">SDE III @ F5 Networks</span>
              </div>
              <div class="snapshot-item">
                <span class="snapshot-label">Experience:</span>
                <span class="snapshot-val">6+ Years</span>
              </div>
              <div class="snapshot-item">
                <span class="snapshot-label">Location:</span>
                <span class="snapshot-val">Bengaluru, India</span>
              </div>
              <div class="snapshot-item">
                <span class="snapshot-label">Specialization:</span>
                <span class="snapshot-val">Go, Distributed Systems, AI Workflows</span>
              </div>
              <div class="snapshot-item">
                <span class="snapshot-label">Email:</span>
                <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="snapshot-val">{SITE.email}</a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="snapshot-actions">
              <a href="/resume" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm btn-full">
                View Full Résumé
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Education -->
          <div class="card sidebar-card">
            <h3 class="sidebar-title">Education</h3>
            <div class="edu-list">
              {
                EDUCATION.map((edu) => (
                  <div class="edu-item">
                    <h4 class="edu-degree">{edu.degree}</h4>
                    <div class="edu-school">{edu.institution}</div>
                    <span class="badge edu-period">{edu.period}</span>
                    {edu.coursework && (
                      <div class="edu-courses">
                        <span class="courses-label">Coursework:</span>
                        <ul class="courses-list">
                          {edu.coursework.map((c) => (
                            <li>&bull; {c}</li>
                          ))}
                        </ul>
                      </div>
                    )}
                  </div>
                ))
              }
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Technical Skills -->
          <div class="card sidebar-card">
            <h3 class="sidebar-title">Technical Skills</h3>
            <div class="skills-groups">
              {
                SKILL_CATEGORIES.map((cat) => (
                  <div class="skill-group">
                    <h4 class="skill-group-title">{cat.title}</h4>
                    <div class="skill-tags">
                      {cat.skills.map((s) => (
                        <span class="badge">{s}</span>
                      ))}
                    </div>
                  </div>
                ))
              }
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding: 3.5rem 0 5rem;
  }

  .page-header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .page-lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 780px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 360px;
    }
  }

  .about-sidebar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  .sidebar-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .sidebar-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .snapshot-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .snapshot-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
  }

  .snapshot-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .snapshot-val {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .btn-full {
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* Education */
  .edu-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .edu-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .edu-degree {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .edu-school {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .edu-period {
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .edu-courses {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .courses-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .courses-list {
    list-style: none;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }

  /* Skills */
  .skills-groups {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .skill-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .skill-group-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .skill-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }
</style>
